{"unit_id":"MrCashmere__dsh-infinite-budget#card-zh","repo":"MrCashmere/dsh-infinite-budget","commit":"10279de0269e0efead4901a086540d872185a5a2","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-infinite-budget 是一个为 DSH 增加系统提示词内容的 Host 插件：它向 systemPrompt 注册一个独立 section，在每次提示词组装时加入预算与额度几乎无限、应专注于最佳结果的提醒。默认顺序为 10150，排在环境信息之后、部署方 persona suffix 之前；文本、顺序和是否按模板解析都可通过 Config 调整。空白文本会跳过注册，非有限顺序会报错；默认保留文本字面内容。插件不注册工具或命令，也没有额外 API Key 或外部服务要求，适合希望统一调整 agent 成本提示的 DSH profile。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:36-49","index.js:57-69"]}
{"unit_id":"MrCashmere__dsh-infinite-budget#card-en","repo":"MrCashmere/dsh-infinite-budget","commit":"10279de0269e0efead4901a086540d872185a5a2","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-infinite-budget adds a configurable system-prompt section through DSH's systemPrompt service. It inserts a budget notice at order 10150; profiles can change its text, order, and template handling. Blank text skips registration. No API key or external service is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:36-49","index.js:57-69"]}
